::  name       caravan caps pair-bound gate
::  shape      [count=@u32 cap=@u32] -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while count stays at or under cap; answers 0 when count exceeds cap
::  example    3 8 -> 1 · 9 8 -> 0 · 8 8 -> 1
::  readers    Caravan · Glow Tend · Ashvini · STOA346
::  nib        equinox-stoa346-caravan-pair-bound-v0
::
::  STOA346 — 2m mirror one. The a1 wall memorized caps-per-dependent; this desk
::  asks the same question with two runtime faces, Tally's pattern mirrored true.
|=  [count=@u32 cap=@u32]
?:  (gth count cap)  0  1
